    "body": "### Problem\n\ndir.lua paths (buffer lines) are relative, so operations like `:!ls <c-a><cr>` don't work.\n\n\n\n### Expected behavior\n\nseems intuitive/useful for dir.lua to set a buffer-local CWD via `:bcd`.\n\nor maybe we should just document how users can opt-in to that, since it's a one-liner:\n\n    :autocmd FileType directory :bcd %\n\ncc @barrettruth ",
